  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS 9643 Sustaining Ecosystem Restoration in Angola&#x2019;s Extended Central Plateau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will apply integrated landscape-based approach for socio-economic and environmental benefits in the headwaters of Angolas central plateau, source of 5 main river basins (the Zambezi, the Kwanza, the Cuando, the Cubango / Okavango, and the Zaire) and restoration of 5 wetlands connected to these basins. The project will focus on planning smart development in the headwaters and leverage on innovative financing models and instruments (such as the PES / CORB Fund) to build resil</narrative>
  </description>
